<section class="window" id="rumours">
  <h2>Rumours</h2>
  <p class="hint">
    What people are saying. A rumour travels one road a day from where it started, and the party hears it when they reach a town it has got to,
    or buys it at a guild. The world starts its own overnight: a caravan lost on a dangerous road, someone who got away seen somewhere new,
    a place changing mode.
  </p>
  <%= render "campaigns/rumours/gm", campaign: campaign %>
</section>
